# Kyriakon.net

Secure email, static web hosting, and pass repositories. Principled hosting, run by Orthodox Christians.

## Secure email and hosting

Prioritize your privacy with secure zero-access mail - built to last, security by design. Your subscription also includes static web hosting and gemini for a simple web presence.

Built on OpenBSD. £20 / Year.

## Kyriakon Press

Orthodox liturgical and catechetical publishing.

## Kleio

The pass-compatible password manager we recommend for communal security. Built for longevity with open-source stewardship.

=> https://github.com/kyriakon/kleio Kleio source repository

> Secure email, server configuration you can audit yourself, and Orthodox admins you can actually meet.

Audit us. Every non-secret piece of infrastructure config is published, including the configuration of the server you are reading this from.

=> https://github.com/kyriakon/kyriakon-infra kyriakon-infra on GitHub

